<x-layouts.frontend title="Frequently Asked Questions — Barama Real Estate">
    <main class="marketplace info-page" id="main-content">
        <p class="marketplace__eyebrow">Help center</p><h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>
        <div class="faq-list">
            <details open><summary>How do I find a property?</summary><p>Open the property catalog to filter by keywords, transaction type, property type and price.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Are listings verified?</summary><p>Listings require administrator approval before publication. Approval does not replace legal, financial or physical due diligence; confirm important details independently.</p></details>
            <details><summary>How can I contact an agent or company?</summary><p>Open a published property and complete its inquiry form. You can review inquiries you submitted while signed in from your account.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Can I save properties?</summary><p>Yes. Sign in, open a published property and select Save property. Saved listings appear in your account until you remove them or publication ends.</p></details>
            <details><summary>How do I request a viewing?</summary><p>From a published property's details, choose a date and submit a viewing request. The request is not a confirmed appointment until arrangements are made with the company.</p></details>
            <details><summary>How can a company publish a listing?</summary><p>Company owners or managers with an approved membership can create drafts, upload gallery images and submit properties for administrator review.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p>Still need help? <a href="{{ route('contact') }}">Contact the Barama team</a>.</p>
    </main>
</x-layouts.frontend>
